    "detailed_description": "In this mechanically challenging 2D hack and slash game, survive through waves of enemies in an ever increasing difficulty, having the satisfaction of feeling your improvement as you learn the enemies and adopt new strategies to deal with them.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLoot, Merge and Upgrade your gear to help you in this difficult adventure.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBeat your friends high score on the endless stage, proving you got the hang of how to survive in Arkhaanis One. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nCONTROLLER HIGHLY RECOMMENDED (the game was not balanced nor made with mouse and keyboard in mind, although it works, it plays a LOT better with a controller).",
